  3
rniture, other doors).\PHall clear width 1500 closed / operating / open.\PRoom-side approach depth: A 1300-1750, B 1200-3010.\PWall change: piers shortened 300 (S) and 100 (N) each side; room areas unchanged.\PDouble-door requirement: met.\PDECISION:
  1
 SELECTED (clearest, no hall obstruction, no wall thickening).
